<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目个体数量已到达100个</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室内形成了一个社会群体，并且群体规模还在增大</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>经过观察，发现项目个体在超过200个时，每三天会有一名个体“死亡”，其余的个体会将同伴的“尸体”放入房屋中，30分钟后，房屋中的“尸体”会以未知方式随机转化为3个积木块。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-关闭记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室中建造了一座城市，其外观与██市完全一致</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00126" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00126" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00126-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609314478" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588077877 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Apr 2020 12:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00256/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个电风扇，当有人坐在其下方时，会认为他/她头上的电风扇摇摇欲坠。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>位于██市██区的一所学校<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-CN-64的低价值收容柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我的天哪！这个电风扇怎么在摆动，要是掉下来怎么办！——一脸惊恐的荣特工<br />
这个电风扇用来测试特工也不错。——Storeshoes博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00256" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00256" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00256-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6056485&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609314478" alt="storeshoes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6056485)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/storeshoes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6056485); return false;">storeshoes</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1592004941 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 Jun 2020 23:35</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">一个人形生物，并未认为有智能。皮肤为白色，高度约为2.38米以上，全身细长且躯干与身体比例严重失衡。当任何生物将目光注视此异常的面部或此异常的面部视频，照片时，此异常将会开始以人类声音啼哭。在1到2分钟后，其将用35千米到███千米/秒的速度冲向该个体，并且在用美式英语对该个体说“Happy April Fools' Day”之后试图回到收容所。目前看来，任何已知材料或者方法都不可能阻止其前进。</span>在2020/7/01时失去异常性质并变为无法摧毁的雕像。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██的前台，此异常被当作愚人节礼物寄往基金会。已提交关于是否可将此异常纳入普通SCP列表中的申请。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>在此异常的脚踝处写有：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>make sure ur havin' fun wis dis gift!</p>
</div>
<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">收容于Site-CN-75的人形异常收容间</span>收容于Site-CN-75的低价值异常物品储存间
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/26</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>from: SCP財団(JP)<br />
to: SCP基金会(CN)</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/27</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>SCP-096, the shy guy<br />
happy April Fools' Day!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/7/03</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>因在2020/7/01，此异常变为无法摧毁的雕像后失去了所有异常性质，对于将此异常列为正式的SCP的申请已被驳回。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00093" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00093-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5637670&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609314478" alt="on-no" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5637670)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;">on-no</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587287518 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Apr 2020 09:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00483/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个██牌的酸奶瓶，当任意人类的舌头触碰瓶盖内部时，瓶盖内部会以█ml/s的速率产出原成分酸奶。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>陈博士的书桌<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>由site-█食堂自助餐区保管<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><br />
我说不会真的有人想舔我用过的瓶盖吧？<br />
——陈博士<br />
我们会对使用过的瓶盖定期清理消毒，请放心<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">使</span>食用。<br />
——site —█的食堂主管</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00483" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00483" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00483-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/blue-melody" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6733419); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6733419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609314478" alt="blue_melody" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6733419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/blue-melody" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6733419); return false;">blue_melody</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1608362371 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Dec 2020 07:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
